OL,3,GNEWSAKey route into city centre closed
OL,4,Aafter crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA key route into Bristol city centre
OL,7,Fhas been closed for several hours due
OL,8,Fto a crash.
OL,10,FAvon and Somerset Police said officers
OL,11,Fwere called to reports of the incident
OL,12,Fon the A4320 St Philip's Causeway at
OL,13,F09:00 GMT, and subsequently closed the
OL,14,Fdual carriageway in both directions.
OL,16,FThe southbound carriageway has now
OL,17,Freopened but northbound remains closed
OL,18,Fwhile investigation work continues.
OL,19,FTraffic is queueing between the
OL,20,FLawrence Hill roundabout and The Retail
OL,21,FPark. There is a diversion in place
OL,22,Fwith congestion on nearby routes.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
